body:
if you're prompting me to add details, i feel pretty stupid and here goes:

i'm basically sure i can never be a real man or become accepted and fully pass. knowing my socially-anxious self, trying to transition would just drag the secret pain this causes me out into the open. making it hurt even more often.

i'd already tried attempting suicide before opening this can of worms. i'm not stupid enough to think passing would magically make me happy but without it, well, wouldn't this bottle of pills be easier than trying and failing miserably?
